{"id":"c7","kind":"web","text":"정확도가 오른 세 이유: retired thinking setting 은 API 가 라우팅 요청 전부를 거부했고, 모순 환불 규칙은 환불 네 건을 보류했고, manual scratchpad 는 세 건에서 tool call 을 reasoning 안에 쓰고 실행하지 않았다 (07장 표 4열, 08장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Instructions · How to fix it","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Instructions · How to fix it","quote":"The retired thinking setting made the API reject every routing request outright. The contradictory refund rules led Opus 5 to withhold four refunds it owed while it asked the customer to confirm. And the manual scratchpad collided with Opus 5's built-in thinking: on three tickets it wrote the tool call inside its reasoning and never executed it."}]}
{"id":"c8","kind":"web","text":"실험은 깨끗한 프롬프트에 anti-pattern 을 하나씩 심어 legacy 프롬프트 여섯 개를 만들었다 (08장 dek, 17장 3)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Instructions · How to fix it","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Instructions · How to fix it","quote":"We started from a clean prompt and planted one anti-pattern at a time (a retired thinking setting, a pair of contradictory refund rules, a manual scratchpad, \"verify twice\", \"be maximally thorough\", and a mandatory six-step procedure), giving six legacy prompts."}]}
{"id":"c9","kind":"web","text":"원문 anti-pattern 목록에서 contradictory rules 는 성능 저하, dated configuration 은 platform 의 거부로 적히고 나머지 넷은 토큰 낭비다. 넷/하나/하나 (07장 h2·3열·note)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Instructions 목록 여섯 항목","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Instructions","quote":"Contradictory instructions (\"always refund within policy\" vs. \"never issue refunds without escalation\") can be followed more literally by frontier models, resulting in degraded performance."},{"source":"w1","locator":"§Instructions","quote":"Dated configuration. Settings written for an older Claude generation (e.g., manual thinking budgets) can be rejected by the Claude Platform when upgrading to frontier models."}]}
