{"id":"c21","kind":"web","text":"cost-optimize 는 토큰 프로파일을 Admin API 의 usage·cost report, 응답의 usage object, 요청 조립 코드 추정 세 경로 순으로 얻고, 레버를 prompt caching → 요청 trimming(prompt-audit 포함) → 출력 bounding → batching 순으로 매기며 평가가 있을 때만 effort·모델을 계산한다 (12장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Automating cost reduction","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Automating cost reduction","quote":"cost-optimize starts by finding where your tokens go: from your organization's usage and cost reports if you have a Claude Admin API key, from the usage object on each API response if your application logs it, or, failing both, by reading your request-building code and estimating."},{"source":"w1","locator":"§Automating cost reduction","quote":"It then ranks the available savings, starting with prompt caching, trimming what each request carries (including a prompt-audit), bounding output, and batching unattended work. If you supply an evaluation, it goes further and computes cost and performance across effort levels and model choices."}]}
{"id":"c22","kind":"numeric","text":"FrontierCode Diamond 에서 Fable 5 는 low 11.5% $5.35, max 30.9% $19.00. 점수 약 2.7×(+19), 비용 약 3.5× (09장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Effort","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Effort","quote":"Claude Fable 5 scores 11.5% at low effort for $5.35 per task on FrontierCode Diamond (the hardest 50 tasks). At max effort, Fable 5 gets 30.9% for $19.00 per task; changing effort raises the score about 2.7x (+19 points) for about 3.5x the cost (Figure 4)."}]}
