{"id":"c26","kind":"web","text":"캐시의 세 제약: 특정 모델에 pinned, 전체 구간 byte-exact, 제한된 TTL (04장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Prompt cache","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Prompt cache","quote":"First, the prompt cache is pinned to a specific model. Second, prompt cache reads must be byte-exact across the full span of the prompt. Finally, the prompt cache has a limited time-to-live (TTL)."}]}
{"id":"c27","kind":"web","text":"effort·thinking 설정은 내용보다 앞에 렌더되어 cached prefix 의 일부이고, Opus 5 와 Fable 5.1 만 대화 중 effort 변경이 캐시를 깨지 않는다 (04장 1행, 15장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Prompt cache · tips","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Prompt cache · tips","quote":"These settings render into the prompt ahead of your content, so they are part of the cached prefix. With Claude Opus 5 and Fable 5.1 specifically, you can update effort mid-conversation without breaking the cache."}]}
{"id":"c28","kind":"web","text":"fork 가 부모 캐시를 공유하는 조건은 prefix byte-identical, 같은 모델, 같은 effort 셋 전부다 (04장 fork 행)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Prompt cache · tips","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Prompt cache · tips","quote":"Subagents and branches only share the parent's cache when the fork's prefix is byte-identical, on the same model, and using the same effort."}]}
{"id":"c29","kind":"numeric","text":"TTL 을 넘기면 다음 턴은 읽기 가격 대신 쓰기 가격 1.25× (1시간 캐시는 2×) 를 낸다 (02·04장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Prompt cache · tips, d2 pricing 표","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Prompt cache · tips","quote":"The next turn has to rewrite the cache, at 1.25× the normal input price (2× for a 1-hour cache) instead of the cheap read price."},{"source":"d2","locator":"§Prompt caching pricing 표 + 각주 1","quote":"5-minute cache write | 1.25x base input price ... 1-hour cache write | 2x base input price ... Cache read (hit) | 0.1x base input price (0.025x on Claude Fable 5.1 and Claude Mythos 5.1)"}]}
{"id":"c30","kind":"numeric","text":"5분 TTL 은 요청 시작부터 세고 5분 넘게 도는 tool call·subagent 에는 1시간 TTL 을 건다 (05장 8행, 15장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Prompt cache · How to fix it","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Prompt cache · How to fix it","quote":"The 5-minute cache TTL counts from the start of the request. If an agent blocks on tool calls or sub-agent requests that run longer than 5 minutes, the parent's cache expires before the result comes back. In cases like this, consider setting a 1-hour TTL on the prefix instead."}]}
{"id":"c31","kind":"web","text":"pre-warm 은 max_tokens: 0 과 명시적 breakpoint 로 요청을 보내 생성 없이 캐시에 쓴다 (05장 7행)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Prompt cache · How to fix it","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Prompt cache · How to fix it","quote":"To reduce latency, send a request with max_tokens: 0 and an explicit cache breakpoint. This processes the prompt and writes it to the cache without generating anything."}]}
{"id":"c32","kind":"web","text":"automatic caching 은 요청 본문 최상위 cache_control 하나로 켜고 마지막 cacheable block 에 breakpoint 를 자동으로 붙인다 (05장 6행)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w1 §Prompt cache · How to fix it, d3 §Automatic caching","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Prompt cache · How to fix it","quote":"With Claude Platform, you can set automatic caching to automatically apply the cache breakpoint to the last cacheable block."},{"source":"d3","locator":"§Automatic caching","quote":"Instead of placing `cache_control` on individual content blocks, add a single `cache_control` field at the top level of your request body. The system automatically applies the cache breakpoint to the last cacheable block."}]}
