{"id":"c37","kind":"absence","text":"고정 커밋 41bbe19 의 Subcommands 표는 migrate / prompt-audit / upgrade / cost-optimize 넷이고 hillclimb 는 없다. 저장소 전체에서 'hillclimb' 는 cost-optimization.md 12행 한 곳뿐이다 (14장, 02·15·16·17·18장이 가리킴)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"r1 41bbe19 전체 트리 419 파일","search":"cd /tmp/skills-checkout && git grep -n -i hillclimb  # → skills/claude-api/shared/cost-optimization.md:12 한 줄","evidence":[{"source":"r1","locator":"skills/claude-api/SKILL.md:57","quote":"| `migrate` | Migrate existing Claude API code to a newer model."},{"source":"r1","locator":"skills/claude-api/shared/cost-optimization.md:12","quote":"once the project has an eval, the levers become a hillclimb - one change at a time against the eval, keep or revert (Step 3)."}]}
{"id":"c38","kind":"doc","text":"Subcommands 표에 없는 문자열을 치면 skill 은 일반 산문으로 취급한다 (14장 note)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"r1 41bbe19 SKILL.md Subcommands 절","evidence":[{"source":"r1","locator":"skills/claude-api/SKILL.md:55","quote":"If no table in the document matches, treat the request as normal prose."}]}
{"id":"c39","kind":"doc","text":"prompt-audit 는 감사 보고서(file:line, 패턴, 왜 낡았는지, 확신도)와 제안 diff 두 개를 항상 내고 사용자 동의 없이 적용하지 않는다 (14장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"r1 41bbe19 shared/prompt-audit.md 서두","evidence":[{"source":"r1","locator":"skills/claude-api/shared/prompt-audit.md:9","quote":"**An audit report**: every finding with its location (`file:line`), the pattern it matches, why it is obsolete for the target model, and a confidence level."},{"source":"r1","locator":"skills/claude-api/shared/prompt-audit.md:10","quote":"**A proposed diff**: concrete edits for the findings that warrant them. Propose - never apply edits without the user's consent."}]}
{"id":"c40","kind":"doc","text":"prompt-audit 는 비대화형이라 가정을 적고 진행한다 (14장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"r1 41bbe19 shared/prompt-audit.md Step 0","evidence":[{"source":"r1","locator":"skills/claude-api/shared/prompt-audit.md:18","quote":"This audit is non-interactive by design: it runs the same way in a chat session, a CI job, or a batch migration, so it states its assumptions and proceeds instead of pausing for confirmation."}]}
{"id":"c41","kind":"doc","text":"prompt-audit 의 target 모델은 요청에 적힌 모델 → 저장소의 migration 문서 → 저장소 코드가 가리키는 최신 모델 → 현재 flagship 순으로 정한다 (14장 '필요한 것')","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"r1 41bbe19 shared/prompt-audit.md Step 0 항목 2","evidence":[{"source":"r1","locator":"skills/claude-api/shared/prompt-audit.md:21","quote":"Resolve the target in this order: the model the request names; else the destination of an in-progress migration the repository documents (vendor notes, migration docs, TODOs); else the newest model the repository's own code or docs point at; else the current flagship"}]}
{"id":"c42","kind":"doc","text":"prompt-audit 의 삭제 규칙은 'could the model already know this?' 한 질문이고 keep list 는 'Context is never cruft', 'Cruft != length' 로 시작한다 (14장 카드)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"r1 41bbe19 shared/prompt-audit.md Step 3 와 What not to flag","evidence":[{"source":"r1","locator":"skills/claude-api/shared/prompt-audit.md:43","quote":"For each instruction, ask one question: **could the model already know this?**"},{"source":"r1","locator":"skills/claude-api/shared/prompt-audit.md:177","quote":"**Context is never cruft.** Audience, product, environment facts, quality bar, constraints, and the *reasons* for them - what only the author knows."},{"source":"r1","locator":"skills/claude-api/shared/prompt-audit.md:178","quote":"**Cruft != length.** The harm comes from specific outdated instructions, not from volume. Never justify a deletion by character count alone."}]}
{"id":"c43","kind":"doc","text":"cost-optimize 의 레버는 공짜 레버(caching, 입력 hygiene 과 prompt audit, loop hygiene, 출력 hygiene, batch)가 먼저이고 tradeoff 레버(budget, effort, 모델, multi-model)가 마지막이다. effort 는 tradeoff 쪽이다 (12·14장, 03장 dek)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"r1 41bbe19 shared/cost-optimization.md 서두","evidence":[{"source":"r1","locator":"skills/claude-api/shared/cost-optimization.md:9","quote":"**Free wins** - prompt caching, input-token hygiene (including a prompt audit), loop hygiene, output-token hygiene, batch processing - lower what you pay without lowering output quality. They go first, and caching stays on permanently."},{"source":"r1","locator":"skills/claude-api/shared/cost-optimization.md:10","quote":"**Tradeoffs** - budgets, effort, model choice, multi-model architectures - exchange cost for intelligence. They go last"}]}
{"id":"c44","kind":"doc","text":"cost-optimize 는 대화형이고, 평가가 없으면 tradeoff 레버를 'needs an eval before applying' 으로 표시하며, 돈이 드는 실행은 사용자 승인을 받는다 (12장 note, 14장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"r1 41bbe19 shared/cost-optimization.md Step 0 와 Step 3","evidence":[{"source":"r1","locator":"skills/claude-api/shared/cost-optimization.md:20","quote":"Unlike the prompt audit, this workflow is interactive by design: when context for a lever is missing, or a step would spend real money, work through it with the user rather than assuming."},{"source":"r1","locator":"skills/claude-api/shared/cost-optimization.md:23","quote":"Do not stop - free wins are safe to propose regardless - but mark every tradeoff lever \"needs an eval before applying\", and ask the user what outcome check they can provide."},{"source":"r1","locator":"skills/claude-api/shared/cost-optimization.md:182","quote":"**Ask for the measurement budget once, not per run.** Present the validation plan with its total expected runs and cost"}]}
{"id":"c45","kind":"doc","text":"평가가 없을 때 skill 은 실제 요청 20~30건짜리 minimal eval 을 함께 만들자고 제안한다 (12장 note)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"r1 41bbe19 shared/cost-optimization.md Step 3","evidence":[{"source":"r1","locator":"skills/claude-api/shared/cost-optimization.md:185","quote":"**Minimal eval recipe** - the cheapest thing that clears a tradeoff lever, so \"needs an eval\" is a next step rather than a dead end."},{"source":"r1","locator":"skills/claude-api/shared/cost-optimization.md:186","quote":"a fixed set of ~20-30 real requests pulled from production logs or written by the user"}]}
{"id":"c46","kind":"doc","text":"cost-optimize 는 레버당 diff 하나를 만들어 되돌리기가 깨끗하다 (14장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"r1 41bbe19 shared/cost-optimization.md Step 3","evidence":[{"source":"r1","locator":"skills/claude-api/shared/cost-optimization.md:181","quote":"Each lever that earns a place becomes **its own diff** (one lever per diff, so a revert is clean and effects attribute)"}]}
{"id":"c47","kind":"doc","text":"effort 는 output_config.effort 로 주고 low/medium/high/xhigh/max 다섯 단계, 기본값 high (09장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"r1 41bbe19 SKILL.md Thinking & Effort 절과 d1","evidence":[{"source":"r1","locator":"skills/claude-api/SKILL.md:243","quote":"**Effort (GA, no beta header):** `output_config: {effort: \"low\"|\"medium\"|\"high\"|\"xhigh\"|\"max\"}` - inside `output_config`, not top-level; default `high` (equivalent to omitting it)."}]}
{"id":"c48","kind":"web","text":"max 는 되지만 xhigh 는 안 되는 모델이 있다 (Opus 4.6, Sonnet 4.6, Mythos Preview) (09장 note)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"d1 §Effort levels 표. max 행은 Fable 5.1, Mythos 5.1, Fable 5, Mythos 5, Mythos Preview, Opus 5, Opus 4.8, Opus 4.7, Opus 4.6, Sonnet 5, Sonnet 4.6 이고 xhigh 행은 Fable 5.1, Mythos 5.1, Fable 5, Mythos 5, Opus 5, Opus 4.8, Opus 4.7, Sonnet 5 다. 차집합은 Mythos Preview, Opus 4.6, Sonnet 4.6 셋. 2026-09-09 열람","evidence":[{"source":"d1","locator":"§Effort levels 표와 그 아래 문장","quote":"Not every model that supports `max` supports `xhigh`."}]}
{"id":"c49","kind":"web","text":"per-message effort 는 beta header mid-conversation-output-config-2026-07-01 을 쓰고 Fable 5 처럼 지원하지 않는 모델은 400 을 낸다 (15장, 19장)","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"d1 §Change effort mid-conversation. 2026-09-09 열람","evidence":[{"source":"d1","locator":"§Change effort mid-conversation / Per-message effort (beta)","quote":"Per-message effort is in beta and requires the beta header `mid-conversation-output-config-2026-07-01`. Models without per-message effort, including Claude Fable 5, return a 400 error"}]}
